ng":"H6223"},{"text":" will not suffer","strong":"H3240"},{"text":" him to sleep","strong":"H3462"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17410,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:13","segments":["There is a sore evil [which] I have seen under the sun, [namely], riches kept for the owners thereof to their hurt."],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"There is","strong":"H3426"},{"text":" a sore","strong":"H2470"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" [which] I have seen","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" under the sun","strong":"H8121"},{"text":", [namely], riches","strong":"H6239"},{"text":" kept","strong":"H8104"},{"text":" for the owners","strong":"H1167"},{"text":" thereof to their hurt","strong":"H7451"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17411,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:14","segments":["But those riches perish by evil travail: and he begetteth a son, and [there is] nothing in his hand."],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"But those riches","strong":"H6239"},{"text":" perish","strong":"H6"},{"text":" by evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" travail","strong":"H6045"},{"text":": and he begetteth","strong":"H3205"},{"text":" a son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":", and [there is] nothing","strong":"H3972"},{"text":" in his hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17412,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:15","segments":["As he came forth of his mother's womb, naked shall he return to go as he came, and shall take nothing of his labour, which he may carry away in his hand."],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"As he came forth","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" of his mother's","strong":"H517"},{"text":" womb","strong":"H990"},{"text":", naked","strong":"H6174"},{"text":" shall he return","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" to go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" as he came","strong":"H935"},{"text":", and shall take","strong":"H5375"},{"text":" nothing","strong":"H3972"},{"text":" of his labour","strong":"H5999"},{"text":", which he may carry away","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" in his hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17413,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:16","segments":["And this also [is] a sore evil, [that] in all points as he came, so shall he go: and what profit hath he that hath laboured for the wind?"],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"And this","strong":"H2090"},{"text":" also [is] a sore","strong":"H2470"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":", [that] in all points","strong":"H5980"},{"text":" as he came","strong":"H935"},{"text":", so shall he go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":": and what profit","strong":"H3504"},{"text":" hath he that hath laboured","strong":"H5998"},{"text":" for the wind","strong":"H7307"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":17414,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:17","segments":["All his days also he eateth in darkness, and [he hath] much sorrow and wrath with his sickness."],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"All his days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" also he eateth","strong":"H398"},{"text":" in darkness","strong":"H2822"},{"text":", and [he hath] much","strong":"H7235"},{"text":" sorrow","strong":"H3707"},{"text":" and wrath","strong":"H7110"},{"text":" with his sickness","strong":"H2483"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17415,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:18","segments":["¶Behold [that] which I have seen: [it is] good and comely [for one] to eat and to drink, and to enjoy the good of all his labour that he taketh under the sun all the days of his life, which God giveth him: for it [is] his portion. {It is good...: Heb. there is a good which is comely, etc} {all the days: Heb. the number of the days}"],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"¶Behold [that] which I have seen","strong":"H7200"},{"text":": [it is] good","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" and comely","strong":"H3303"},{"text":" [for one] to eat","strong":"H398"},{"text":" and to drink","strong":"H8354"},{"text":", and to enjoy","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" the good","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" of all his labour","strong":"H5999"},{"text":" that he taketh","strong":"H5998"},{"text":" under the sun","strong":"H8121"},{"text":" all","strong":"H4557"},{"text":" the days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of his life","strong":"H2416"},{"text":", which God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" giveth","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" him: for it [is] his portion","strong":"H2506"},{"text":". {It is good...: Heb. there is a good which is comely, etc} {all the days: Heb. the number of the days}"}]},{"id":17416,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:19","segments":["Every man also to whom God hath given riches and wealth, and hath given him power to eat thereof, and to take his portion, and to rejoice in his labour; this [is] the gift of God."],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"Every man","strong":"H120"},{"text":" also to whom God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" hath given","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" riches","strong":"H6239"},{"text":" and wealth","strong":"H5233"},{"text":", and hath given him power","strong":"H7980"},{"text":" to eat","strong":"H398"},{"text":" thereof, and to take","strong":"H5375"},{"text":" his portion","strong":"H2506"},{"text":", and to rejoice","strong":"H8055"},{"text":" in his labour","strong":"H5999"},{"text":"; this","strong":"H2090"},{"text":" [is] the gift","strong":"H4991"},{"text":" of God","strong":"H430"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":17417,"title":"Ecclesiastes 5:20","segments":["For he shall not much remember the days of his life; because God answereth [him] in the joy of his heart. {For...: or, Though he give not much, yet he remembereth, etc}"],"ref":"Ecclesiastes 5:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"For he shall not much","strong":"H7235"},{"text":" remember","strong":"H2142"},{"text":" the days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of his life","strong":"H2416"},{"text":"; because God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" answereth","strong":"H6031"},{"text":" [him] in the joy","strong":"H8057"},{"text":" of his heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":". {For...: or, Though he give not much, yet he remembereth, etc}"}]}]}
